<article id="post-36926" class="post-36926 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-awards category-featured category-news tag-global-aam-awards-2026 tag-naamce tag-north-america">
	
				<div class="cm-featured-image">
				<img width="2560" height="1440" src="https://evtolinsights.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/PXL_20260430_193406776-scaled.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="A row of blue glass awards labeled WINNER on a blue table at an awards ceremony display area." decoding="async" srcset="https://evtolinsights.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/PXL_20260430_193406776-scaled.jpg 2560w, https://evtolinsights.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/PXL_20260430_193406776-300x169.jpg 300w, https://evtolinsights.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/PXL_20260430_193406776-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://evtolinsights.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/PXL_20260430_193406776-768x432.jpg 768w, https://evtolinsights.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/PXL_20260430_193406776-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://evtolinsights.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/PXL_20260430_193406776-2048x1152.jpg 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px" title="PXL_20260430_193406776 - eVTOL Insights" />			</div>

			
	<div class="cm-post-content">
		<div class="cm-entry-header-meta"><div class="cm-post-categories"><a href="https://evtolinsights.com/category/awards/" rel="category tag">Awards</a><a href="https://evtolinsights.com/category/featured/" rel="category tag">Featured</a><a href="https://evtolinsights.com/category/news/" rel="category tag">News</a></div></div>
				<header class="cm-entry-header">
				<h1 class="cm-entry-title">
			Winners Revealed at eVTOL Insights’ Global AAM Awards 2026 Following Its North America Conference at NAAMCE		</h1>
							</header>

			<div class="cm-below-entry-meta "><span class="cm-post-date"><a href="https://evtolinsights.com/winners-revealed-at-evtol-insights-global-aam-awards-2026-following-its-north-america-conference-at-naamce/" title="12:43" rel="bookmark"><svg class="cm-icon cm-icon--calendar-fill" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21.1 6.6v1.6c0 .6-.4 1-1 1H3.9c-.6 0-1-.4-1-1V6.6c0-1.5 1.3-2.8 2.8-2.8h1.7V3c0-.6.4-1 1-1s1 .4 1 1v.8h5.2V3c0-.6.4-1 1-1s1 .4 1 1v.8h1.7c1.5 0 2.8 1.3 2.8 2.8zm-1 4.6H3.9c-.6 0-1 .4-1 1v7c0 1.5 1.3 2.8 2.8 2.8h12.6c1.5 0 2.8-1.3 2.8-2.8v-7c0-.6-.4-1-1-1z"></path></svg> <time class="entry-date published updated" datetime="2026-05-01T12:43:41+01:00">1 May 2026</time></a></span>
		<span class="cm-author cm-vcard">
			<svg class="cm-icon cm-icon--user" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 7c0-2.8 2.2-5 5-5s5 2.2 5 5-2.2 5-5 5-5-2.2-5-5zm9 7H8c-2.8 0-5 2.2-5 5v2c0 .6.4 1 1 1h16c.6 0 1-.4 1-1v-2c0-2.8-2.2-5-5-5z"></path></svg>			<a class="url fn n"
			href="https://evtolinsights.com/author/jasonpritchard/"
			title="Jason Pritchard"
			>
				Jason Pritchard			</a>
		</span>

		</div>
		<div class="cm-entry-summary">
	
<p>eVTOL Insights is proud to announce the win­ners of its 2026 Glob­al AAM Awards, rec­og­niz­ing the indi­vid­u­als, teams and com­pa­nies which have demon­strat­ed out­stand­ing achieve­ment, inno­va­tion, and lead­er­ship in the  glob­al Advanced Air Mobil­i­ty mar­ket.</p>



<p>The awards cel­e­brate progress across the indus­try, from tech­no­log­i­cal advance­ments and infra­struc­ture devel­op­ment to ecosys­tem col­lab­o­ra­tion and mar­ket lead­er­ship. This year’s win­ners rep­re­sent the cut­ting edge of sus­tain­able avi­a­tion and urban air mobil­i­ty solu­tions.</p>



<p>Each win­ner was select­ed by a judg­ing pan­el of indus­try experts, based on cri­te­ria includ­ing tech­no­log­i­cal inno­va­tion, scal­a­bil­i­ty, envi­ron­men­tal impact, and con­tri­bu­tion to the advance­ment of the AAM ecosys­tem.</p>



<p>The awards were pre­sent­ed after eVTOL Insights’ North Amer­i­ca Con­fer­ence, which took place yes­ter­day (Thurs­day) at the Nation­al Advanced Air Mobil­i­ty Cen­ter of Excel­lence (NAAMCE).</p>



<p>The event also rep­re­sent­ed the first time an eVTOL air­craft has flown at an eVTOL Insights’ event, with Tim Lum pilot­ing his Piv­otal Black­fly eVTOL air­craft around out­side the hangar and giv­ing del­e­gates a rare oppor­tu­ni­ty to see elec­tric flight in action.</p>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>2026 Global AAM Award Winners</strong></h2>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Team Categories</strong></h2>



<p>Best Place to Work<br>Win­ner: <strong>Hori­zon Air­craft</strong></p>



<p>Best Aware­ness Rais­ers<br>High­ly Com­mend­ed: <strong>Hon­ey­well</strong> &amp; <strong>UAM Geo­mat­ics Inc.</strong><br>Win­ner: <strong>Sky­Drive</strong></p>



<p>Small Mar­ket­ing Team of the Year<br>Win­ner: <strong>Archer</strong></p>



<p>Large Engi­neer­ing Team of the Year<br>Win­ner: <strong>Wisk</strong></p>



<p>Small Design Team of the Year<br>Win­ner: <strong>Olsen Actu­a­tors &amp; Dri­ves</strong></p>



<p>Small Engi­neer­ing Team of the Year<br>High­ly Com­mend­ed: <strong>Hori­zon Air­craft</strong><br>Win­ner: <strong>Piv­otal</strong></p>



<p>Autonomous Flight Inno­va­tion Award<br>Win­ner: <strong>Wisk</strong></p>



<p>Infra­struc­ture Inno­va­tion of the Year Award<br>Win­ner: <strong>Sun­Trax — Flori­da DOT</strong></p>



<p>Train­ing and Work­force Devel­op­ment Award<br>Win­ner: <strong>Joby Avi­a­tion</strong><br></p>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Individual Categories</strong></h2>



<p>Leader of the Year<br>High­ly Com­mend­ed: <strong>Adam Gold­stein — Archer</strong><br>Win­ner: <strong>Dan Sloat — AAM Insti­tute</strong><br><br>Tech­nol­o­gy Leader of the Year<br>Win­ner: Tom Muniz — Archer</p>



<p>Test Pilot of the Year<br>Win­ner: <strong>James ‘Bud­dy’ Den­ham</strong></p>



<p>Out­stand­ing Con­tri­bu­tion<br>Win­ner: <strong>Huazhi Hu — EHang</strong></p>



<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Company Categories</strong></h2>



<p>AAM Soft­ware Inno­va­tion of the Year<br>Win­ner: XSTAR — Alci­fo</p>



<p>Cer­ti­fi­ca­tion Pio­neer<br>Win­ner: <strong>Hon­ey­well</strong></p>



<p>Glob­al Ecosys­tem Part­ner of the Year<br>Win­ner: <strong>NAAMCE</strong></p>



<p>Com­pa­ny of the Year (50 — 100 Employ­ees)<br>Win­ner: <strong>AIR EV</strong></p>



<p>Com­pa­ny of the Year (100+ Employ­ees)<br>Win­ner: <strong>Viasat</strong></p>



<p>Medaille D’Or<br>Win­ner: <strong>Hon­ey­well</strong></p>
</div>
	
	</div>

	
	</article>
		</div><!-- .cm-posts -->
		
